It should support inline comments
{# hello world #}

It should maintain paragraphs, but not indentation
{#
hello world how are you doing today?
this keeps on going
and it's looking weird
Here's a list of things:
- one
- two
- three

Here's a new paragraph
oh hi!
#}

It should keep the closing delimiter on its own line when written multi-line
{#
    MARK: my comment
#}

It should keep single-line comments on one line
{# MARK: my comment #}

It should collapse empty comments, even when written multi-line
{#
#}
